			],
			"Message": "fix(Land): Advance submodules — Cocoon doc shim, Mountain SCM replay, Output Tauri 2 polyfills, Sky panel routing\n\nAdvance all 13 Element submodules with substantive fixes across Cocoon, Mountain, Output, and Sky, along with a coordinated telemetry field rename and routine documentation submodule updates.\n\n**Cocoon** (`fix`): BuildTextDocumentShim in Notification/Handler returns a full TextDocument-shaped object backed by DocumentContentCache, fixing TypeError crashes in vscode.git diff decorations and vscode.merge-conflict that called `.getText()` on bare `{uri, fileName}` stubs. Fix scmHandle/groupHandle routing in Scm/Namespace so multi-repo SCM updates reach the correct provider. Fix showTextDocument URI resolution for all argument shapes. Rename telemetry config fields PostHog OTLPEndpoint→Pipe, OTLPEnabled→Emit. RouteManifest grows from 140 to 142 RPC methods with `git.openChange` and `git.openFile`.\n\n**Mountain** (`refactor` + `fix`): Replay SCM resource group registration and update events for late SkyBridge subscribers — persist ResourceStates as SourceControlManagementResourceDTO entries keyed by `(ProviderHandle, GroupId)`, then reconstruct GroupHandle at replay time through the provider identifier map. Add replay legs for `sky://scm/registerGroup` and `sky://scm/updateGroup` so the SCM panel populates at boot. Fix LocalPTYGetProfiles Arguments→args casing so terminal profile arguments are parsed correctly. Set the Trace sentinel to explicit categories instead of the catch-all `\"all\"`. Add window management capabilities (start-dragging, toggle-maximize, etc.) enabling the Sky titlebar to drive native chrome. Align SCM DTO import path with Common's reorganized module layout.\n\n**Output** (`fix` + `feat`): Align all ProcessTauri command names to snake_case — Tauri 2 passes the literal Rust function name without auto-camel conversion. Rename update dispatch names to match Mountain's service handler arms (`update:check`→`update:checkForUpdates`, etc.). Expose IOutputService in the CEL accessor so Sky can write to the actual Output panel. Refactor InjectTauriDragRegion from a runtime stylesheet walker (which returns empty strings under WKWebView) to build-time CSS regex extraction, baking drag/no-drag selector arrays into the bundle. Add capture-phase mousedown listener that walks the ancestor chain and dispatches Tauri invoke commands with multiple fallback paths, since Tauri's own drag listener only activates under `tauri://localhost`.\n\n**Sky** (`fix`): Route sky://output/append/clear/replace through `__CEL_SERVICES__.Output.getChannel().append()` instead of the diagnostic console sink, so panel content actually renders. Fix multi-repo SCM deduplication by keying ScmShimRegistry on `scmId#handle` instead of bare `scmId`, giving each repository its own workbench provider. Add snapshot serialization and early-return guards to visibleChanged/tabsChanged handlers, suppressing redundant `$acceptVisibleEditorsChanged` callbacks to Cocoon. Rename OTLP env vars to Pipe/Emit.\n\n**Wind** (`chore` + `refactor`): Remove unused model:updateContent IPC route. Rename Tauri invoke targets `VineSubscribeNotifications`→`vine_subscribe_notifications` and `VineSubscriberCount`→`vine_subscriber_count` to match Mountain's snake_case registration.\n\n**Common, Worker**: Coordinated OTLPEndpoint→Pipe / OTLPEnabled→Emit field rename across Configuration (Rust) and Bridge.ts (TypeScript).\n\n**Air, Echo, Grove, Mist, Rest, SideCar**: Routine Documentation/Rust submodule pointer advances — no functional changes.",
			"SHA": "4a4cfa76166d31a917575eef07e78315a18b806f"
